{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373600/extras/668e17bec974d4a10b44909830bebdd5.avif?t=1764266105\" width=600 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings, living one\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to cross the veil and take on a haunting Solitaire adventure with a mystical twist? Look no further. Your mystical Solitaire adventure awaits in Day of the Dead - Solitaire Collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a spooky and beautiful game for the Halloween season? Step into the vibrant world of D\u00eda de los Muertos and honor the spirits in style. Collect unique cards, master hundreds of layouts, and decorate your very own cemetery to welcome the wandering souls from the Land of the Dead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Decorate the Realm of Spirits \u2013 Unlock and place 20 festive Day of the Dead decorations to create a cemetery unlike any other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Build Your Own Deck \u2013 Discover and collect 35+ beautifully designed cards to customize your Solitaire experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Hundreds of Challenges \u2013 Conquer 100 levels with 3 rounds each for a total of 300 exclusive layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Tricky Obstacles Await \u2013 Outsmart clever mechanics and complete devious tasks as you advance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Boost Your Power \u2013 Use 10 unique boosters to overcome the toughest levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a Solitaire master or just looking for a magical escape, Day of the Dead \u2013 Solitaire Collection offers the perfect mix of mystery, strategy, and festive charm for all Halloween lovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Dare to play\u2026 and welcome the souls from beyond! \u2728 </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg","localized_name":"Undecided","name":"Undecided","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373600/ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg"},{"icon":"ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg","localized_name":"Deck Customization","name":"Deck Customization","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373600/ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg"},{"icon":"ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg","localized_name":"Cards Collection","name":"Cards Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373600/ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg"},{"icon":"ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg","localized_name":"Just an apprentice","name":"Just an apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373600/ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg"},{"icon":"ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg","localized_name":"Half way to mastery","name":"Half way to mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373600/ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg"},{"icon":"ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg","localized_name":"Now I'm the Master","name":"Now I'm the Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373600/ff374b56a36737a35a9c3f42be56b05694d01a22.jpg"},{"icon":"fc0e761af86658c50b3c83613d64ef7d7fd70e85.jpg","localized_name":"Combo Apprentice","name":"Combo Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1373600/fc0e761af86658c50b3c83613d6